ArchExplorer integrates work from:

1. huanyuqu/ArchExplorer, commit 4b1baeba3d02102c96f602f69435c2f57346f309
   Architecture grammar, region specifications, analytical models and search.

2. huanyuqu/MetaDSE, commit 8e74963278958b8c94f0bd1f94d901730c0afbd2
   Python task graph, mapping actions, resource models and discrete-event engine.
   The source repository supplies the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The MetaDSE-derived Python dependency closure has been relocated into
arch_explorer/simulator and arch_explorer/workload. Imports were namespaced;
standalone research demos and the obsolete protobuf loader were excluded;
a communication-point indentation error was corrected, and a type-only torch
dependency was made optional. Further local modifications are described in
docs/integration.md. Original copyright and license terms remain applicable.
The migrated edge transfer volume was corrected to include bytes per element.

The new integration entry points, model adapter, synthetic examples and tests
are distributed with this release under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

3. SCALE-Sim v3 (scalesim 3.0.0, https://github.com/scalesim-project/SCALE-Sim),
   MIT License.
   Optional runtime dependency, installed with the `scalesim` extra and not
   redistributed in this package. arch_explorer/components/systolic_model.py
   is an independent closed-form implementation of SCALE-Sim's GEMM timing
   and SRAM-access semantics, with references to the corresponding SCALE-Sim
   functions; its results are checked against SCALE-Sim in the test suite.


4. Accel-Sim v2.0.1, commit 1c9cc831c5d948f89fa9dc8f21f6c87952f5f2ea.
   The attributed SM90 parameter selections and Hopper opcode-category catalog
   are derived from the fixed upstream source. Native tools and collected
   traces are external resources, not redistributed in the public package.

